# Chart Studio Link Text Was Removed

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:plotly_ex, "~> 0.3"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.18"}
])
```

## Replace the old link

Plotly.js v4 removed `config.linkText` together with the Chart Studio edit link.
There is no replacement edit-link text option. Present your own notebook text
or download the figure JSON using the `downloadJson` modebar button.

The separate Upload to Cloud button is hidden by plotly_ex unless you explicitly
set `showSendToCloud: true`, as demonstrated in notebook 12.
